{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Note: Windows only, no support for MacOS**</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brings Spellmasons characters to life on your desktop!\u00a0 Have the Spellmason, Goru and more keep you company while you watch videos, game, chat, or whatever! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/c41d4f1deb4aca71c56c7b51b2098fdb.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=492 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/c41d4f1deb4aca71c56c7b51b2098fdb.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/c41d4f1deb4aca71c56c7b51b2098fdb.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Currently available characters for the Desktop Pet include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spellmason, Goru, Archer, Golem, Glop, Poisoner, Priest, Summoner and Vampire<br> <br>The desktop pet automatically cycles through animations and is resizable.\u00a0 You can also create more than one at once. <br> <br>Once you download this DLC, there will be a Settings option to spawn a desktop pet in your main game, or you can run the executable yourself in the same directory from where you've installed Spellmasons. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additionally, unlock in-game familiars who follow you as you battle your way through masses of enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenix<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/ac2de451c5ba593a6a2f98a8201a8100.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=282 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/ac2de451c5ba593a6a2f98a8201a8100.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/ac2de451c5ba593a6a2f98a8201a8100.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/d0a617f55dc98a8de7463b472f28f511.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=282 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/d0a617f55dc98a8de7463b472f28f511.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/d0a617f55dc98a8de7463b472f28f511.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/8a5c9a23fd7cbcc22f9a985ee0b2de8f.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=282 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/8a5c9a23fd7cbcc22f9a985ee0b2de8f.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/8a5c9a23fd7cbcc22f9a985ee0b2de8f.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>If you enjoy Spellmasons, purchasing the Desktop Pet is a great way to support my work and help me to continue bringing more to Spellmasons!<br><strong></strong><br><strong>Important Notes</strong><br>- This DLC cosmetic only and does not impact Spellmasons gameplay.  <br>- If you are seeing the Discord overlay covering the Spellmasons pet, you can disable the overlay in Discord &gt; User Settings (the gear icon) &gt; Game Overlay &gt; &quot;Enable Overlay&quot; toggle for Spellmasons.<br>- This DLC works on Windows only.\u00a0 There is no support for MacOS <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026960?t=1761336568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026960?t=1761336568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/57145397f2c0f2f0fd7769ab715c8d790f8e20ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761336568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/57145397f2c0f2f0fd7769ab715c8d790f8e20ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761336568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Sometimes the sprites will play deathanimations which include blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Note: Windows only, no support for MacOS**</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brings Spellmasons characters to life on your desktop!\u00a0 Have the Spellmason, Goru and more keep you company while you watch videos, game, chat, or whatever! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/c41d4f1deb4aca71c56c7b51b2098fdb.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=492 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/c41d4f1deb4aca71c56c7b51b2098fdb.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/c41d4f1deb4aca71c56c7b51b2098fdb.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Currently available characters for the Desktop Pet include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spellmason, Goru, Archer, Golem, Glop, Poisoner, Priest, Summoner and Vampire<br> <br>The desktop pet automatically cycles through animations and is resizable.\u00a0 You can also create more than one at once. <br> <br>Once you download this DLC, there will be a Settings option to spawn a desktop pet in your main game, or you can run the executable yourself in the same directory from where you've installed Spellmasons. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additionally, unlock in-game familiars who follow you as you battle your way through masses of enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenix<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/ac2de451c5ba593a6a2f98a8201a8100.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=282 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/ac2de451c5ba593a6a2f98a8201a8100.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/ac2de451c5ba593a6a2f98a8201a8100.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/d0a617f55dc98a8de7463b472f28f511.poster.avif?t=1761336568\" width=282 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/d0a617f55dc98a8de7463b472f28f511.webm?t=1761336568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026960/extras/d0a617f55dc98a8de7463b472f28f511.mp4?t=1761336568\" type=\"vi